%dl
  %dt App
  %dd Pick-a-Pic: early, easy AAC

  %dt Summary
  %dd Pick-a-Pic is an AAC (augmentative and alternative communication) app for iPad focused on ease-of-use for early learners and their caregivers. It allows caregivers to quickly turn their images into buttons that speak when tapped.
  
  %dt Price
  %dd
    Pick-a-Pic is free to download. A one-time, $9.99 purchase unlocks the full version for life.
  
  %dt Platform
  %dd iPad with iPadOS 26 or later
  
  %dt Release date
  %dd Sept 1, 2026
  
  %dt Developer
  %dd Pocket Pigeon
  
